    "### Function to plot ice depth and error from extracted individual spectrum from step 1. Plot color cc and label nn"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "2edb8624-c832-4309-96ce-c71406064d7c",
